Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, run for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.24,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus he wanted ken to go back\Nto when he wasn't such an evil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jerk so he agreed to help us\Ndestroy the base when we found the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power source it turned into a\Ngolden dga then the most amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:02:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beam of golden armor, then\Nhe Digivolved into Magnamon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.51,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx140\fscy140\pos(321,348)}Goodbye, Ken-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sa-yo-nara, Kin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden Armor energized!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon, Golden Armor is Evolved!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about the coolest\Nthing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get those rad shoulder pads?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use them as boogie boards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Magnamon, a golden-armored Digimon\Nthat attacks with my Magna Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I look so good doing it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My strength is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upamon, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Hawkmon can Golden\NArmor Digivolve. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came from that golden Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis must have unleashed its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can somebody turn off his headlights?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digi-fools, do you honestly\Nthink your new Digimon can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't even be my flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sticks and stones\Ncan break my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when Magnamon gets a hold\Nof you, he'll kick your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would make a good nightlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimeramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's out? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Magnamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show him he's no match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just in case he is,\NI'll get the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shilt thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to drop in like this, but\NChimera-mon is tearing the place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's simply following my orders to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Chimera-mon's not following\Nanyone's orders but his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My greatest creation won't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnum Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have that much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to ditch this place\Nbefore it takes a nosedive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure would be nice to capture the\NDigimon Emperor while we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're aiming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember who your master is, Chimeramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magna can't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I begged you to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're slamming up my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, master, let's leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm his creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:06:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nurtured him from the\Nbeginning with evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These kids today have no respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about it outside\Nwhere it's much safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you little nightcrawler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had a friend, it\Ncertainly wouldn't be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that you finally\Ncome to your senses and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are ready to surrender\Nto me and Chimera-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fat chance, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think some of your hairspray must have\Nleaked through into your brain again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said it was okay for you to go\Nout and create a Digimon anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do you think you're Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein or something, creating\Ncreatures just for your own cruel pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimera-mon is not the\Nmonster, Ken. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not your toys for some kind\Nof a sick game They're alive They're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not just data and a computer They're\Nliving creatures like you and I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Digidestined too, just like us. You
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a responsibility to\Nboth worlds. Like Wormon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's your friend And not\Nsomeone you should kick around
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one Digimon\Nthat's suitable enough for me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's Chimeramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't feel too proud that\Nyou destroyed my home base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you are going down with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garrett, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Button is getting a little hot down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you guys have\Nenough energy to Digipole?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, now let's lean before\NI'm a fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heat is on, guys. Ready? Mm-hmm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi Armor Riders, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Armored Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the drill of knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to say the drill of power, but\NI think this makes me sound smarter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digibomb 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piximon, the wings of Lala.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:09:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Possemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the wings of Lala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all have a life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon on the Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon, flying home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have already started. I'm\Ncelebrating the something never stopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always struggling, but like now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plasma Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too much spinning, cause the page of\Nthe finest thing that's beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the same... Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, that was a gross one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnet blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use... He's too strong.\NI'm running out of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it let him have it chimera\Nmon you can do it magnum on silence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i hope you're finally\Nproud of yourself you've
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,officially become worse\Nthan the monsters you've
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,created whatever happened\Nto that sweet kid i met
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a long time ago who had\Na dream to take over the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digital world okay sure\Nit was a sick and twisted
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dream but still we had\Na lot of laughs together
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happened to the\Nboy i was proud to call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master of course you made me call you that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take it easy i'm not a\Nmelon you've changed ken
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not too late for\Nyou for some reason and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you started capturing\NDigimon and you turned them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into your slaves instead\Nof into your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't agree, but I stuck by your\Nside because I was your Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you started being cruel to\Nme, the one who knows the true you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others may know and fear\Nyou as the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never forget that I know the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always think of you for your\Nkindness, Ken, no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day I hope you'll realize that the\Nreal Ken isn't the Digimon Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Ken that's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And only a real friend would do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wyrmon, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnamon, it's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Magnamon, safe can for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what little energy I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon's power has re-energized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they defeated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone lose their keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't what was supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plans were supposed\Nto work out perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have cheated somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only possible explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have one choice left,\Nand that's just to cheat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to reset the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reset the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just go home and\Ndelete all the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,data off my computer and\Ncreate a new program.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way I can start a new\Ndigital world that doesn't cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world is a\Ncompletely real place, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just something that's\Nprogrammed into your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried to tell you that before,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you thought we were trying to\Nplay some kind of a trick on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't some kind of a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and Digimon are real, and it's about\Ntime you realized what you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been hurting\Ninnocent creatures, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Digimon, were all at the\Nsoccer game in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are real, not just computer data.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that I\Nnever figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, for an evil genius, you\Nreally are a slow learner, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've constantly\Nbeen abusing Digimon ever
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since you claimed to\Nbe the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought my dark rings\Nwere a stroke of a penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never realized I was causing pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made them work for me tirelessly\Nwithout ever giving them a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was cruel to them\Nbeyond imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm a monster i can't believe\Nwhat i've done it's hard to argue
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with you there ken you've done\Nsome pretty horrible stuff the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,important thing is you've realized\Nwhat you've done and it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've returned to your old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:15:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never too late to be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mormont's absolutely right, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that thing, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but it looks like one of the\Ncrests we used to have in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it has the crest of kindness on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is it coming to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it belongs to you, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the crest of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been anything but kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Wizardmon\Nmeant when he told us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that kindness will release\Nthe golden radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken must be the key to\Nunlocking the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you that deep inside you were kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my best friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was helpless to save him, and\Nnow I can't save Wormon either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep losing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to the digital world to\Nget away from all those feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we miss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still people who love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't walk away from your\Nproblems Let us help you, Ken
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Digidestined. Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where he's going\NI hope you'll be okay
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt I made it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, she followed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like a boomerang\Nthat keeps coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's funny, but when you drove\Noff with your tires screeching,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you didn't realize you\Nleft me standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bad. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where are Davis and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Tai knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai, do you know\Nwhere the others went?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think about that for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Izzy, weren't you\Nthe last one to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go find him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digiport is opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the woods are a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you better leave quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell Davis you stopped by. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, June, who invited you\Nto come out here? Matt did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, would it be okay to get\Na ride home with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to take\Nthe bus all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, not in a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you\Ncame all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone take the bus with June.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very nice of you, sir, and I\Nalready have the perfect volunteer in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the absolute perfect volunteer is TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you take the bus\Nhome with June. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more than enough here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have fun, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have her home before curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll trade for your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll sit with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better go catch the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, TK, you can have my college money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in local news, the missing\Nboy genius, Ken Ichichoji,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mysteriously returned home after being\Nmissing for the last several months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Events surrounding his\Npuzzling disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sudden reappearance are still unclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.34,0:20:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his family is thankful to have\Nhim home and safe. Good day. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like the Digi world will be a safer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place from now on without\NKen running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sure must have been\Nsome battle these guys fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we older kids\Ncan take a lot of pride
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we call these beginners\Nthe new Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The torch has been passed, and\Nthey didn't get burned once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little boy is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we lost his\Nbrother, then we lost Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just so glad he's back home.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.54,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
